@startuml
|TeamLeader|
start
:Enter group details (project name, description, objectives);

|GroupCreationPage|
:Submit group details;

|GroupController|
:Request to create group with details;

|GroupService|
:Validate group details;
:Save group details;

|GroupService|
if (Group creation successful?) then (yes)
    :Confirm group creation;
    |GroupCreationPage|
    :Display success message;
    |TeamLeader|
    :Show success message;
else (no)
    :Return error status;
    |GroupCreationPage|
    :Display error message;
    |TeamLeader|
    :Show error message;
endif

|TeamLeader|
:View and manage group settings (if applicable);
stop
@enduml